${H1}Programs that take over the screen${RST}

Most commands print and return. A few take over the screen until you
leave them; the prompt is gone while they run.

  ${CMD}man ls${RST}       ${DIM}# the manual page for ls; q leaves${RST}

${CMD}man${RST} and ${CMD}less${RST} leave with ${BOLD}q${RST}. Vim leaves differently; that is next.

